url: "https://writerforight.github.io/mlp-space-deformation/"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-10-04"
keywords:
  - neural networks
  - visualization
  - backpropagation
  - jacobian
  - neural tangent kernel
  - catastrophic forgetting
  - topology
